@page "/changelog"

<PageTitle>Changelog</PageTitle>

<h3 class="text-center">Changelog</h3>
<div class="d-flex flex-wrap align-items-center justify-content-center mb-2">
    <div class="m-2"><span class="bi-x-lg text-danger"></span> Bug</div>
    <div class="m-2"><span class="bi-exclamation-triangle text-warning"></span> Change</div>
    <div class="m-2"><span class="bi-recycle text-purple"></span> Refactoring</div>
    <div class="m-2"><span class="bi-check2 text-primary"></span> Improvement</div>
    <div class="m-2"><span class="bi-plus-lg text-success"></span> Feature</div>
</div>
<div class="row border-top border-bottom mb-3">
    <div class="col col-4">
        <h5 class="text-end  py-2">Version 3.0.2</h5>
    </div>
    <div class="col col-8 px-0">
        <ul class="list-group list-group-flush border-start">
            <li class="list-group-item text-truncate"><span class="bi-check2 text-primary"></span> Improved animations</li>
            <li class="list-group-item text-truncate"><span class="bi-x-lg text-danger"></span> Fix single slice rendering for circular charts</li>
            <li class="list-group-item text-truncate"><span class="bi-x-lg text-danger"></span> Fix ticks for negative intervals</li>
            <li class="list-group-item text-truncate"><span class="bi-x-lg text-danger"></span> Fix zero size axis-interval</li>
        </ul>
    </div>
</div>
<div class="row border-top border-bottom mb-3">
    <div class="col col-4">
        <h5 class="text-end  py-2">Version 3.0</h5>
    </div>
    <div class="col col-8 px-0">
        <ul class="list-group list-group-flush border-start">
            <li class="list-group-item text-truncate"><span class="bi-plus-lg text-success"></span> Add Circular parameter to RadarChart</li>
            <li class="list-group-item text-truncate"><span class="bi-plus-lg text-success"></span> Add InnerAxis parameter to Speedometer</li>
            <li class="list-group-item text-truncate"><span class="bi-plus-lg text-success"></span> Add Scatter chart</li>
            <li class="list-group-item text-truncate"><span class="bi-plus-lg text-success"></span> Add Stepline chart</li>
            <li class="list-group-item text-truncate"><span class="bi-plus-lg text-success"></span> Add Bubbles chart</li>
            <li class="list-group-item text-truncate"><span class="bi-check2 text-primary"></span> Centralized axis rendering</li>
            <li class="list-group-item text-truncate"><span class="bi-check2 text-primary"></span> Centralized text rendering</li>
            <li class="list-group-item text-truncate"><span class="bi-recycle text-purple"></span> Refactoring Line chart</li>
            <li class="list-group-item text-truncate"><span class="bi-recycle text-purple"></span> Replaced Linegram and Line models with Cartesiangram</li>
            <li class="list-group-item text-truncate"><span class="bi-recycle text-purple"></span> Reduced namespaces to only BlazorGraphs and BlazorGraphs.Components</li>
            <li class="list-group-item text-truncate"><span class="bi-exclamation-triangle text-warning"></span> Changed color properties to use Color type instead of KnownColor enum</li>
            <li class="list-group-item text-truncate"><span class="bi-exclamation-triangle text-warning"></span> Unified Polargram and Piegram models to Circulargram</li>
            <li class="list-group-item text-truncate"><span class="bi-exclamation-triangle text-warning"></span> Renamed BarChart as VerticalBarChart</li>
            <li class="list-group-item text-truncate"><span class="bi-exclamation-triangle text-warning"></span> Renamed PolarChart as PolarAreaChart</li>
            <li class="list-group-item text-truncate"><span class="bi-exclamation-triangle text-warning"></span> Renamed LinearGauge as HorizontalGauge</li>
            <li class="list-group-item text-truncate"><span class="bi-exclamation-triangle text-warning"></span> Removed obsolete component LegendBar</li>
            <li class="list-group-item text-truncate"><span class="bi-exclamation-triangle text-warning"></span> Removed enums</li>
        </ul>
    </div>
</div>
<div class="row border-top border-bottom mb-3">
    <div class="col col-4">
        <h5 class="text-end  py-2">Version 2.4</h5>
    </div>
    <div class="col col-8 px-0">
        <ul class="list-group list-group-flush border-start">
            <li class="list-group-item text-truncate"><span class="bi-plus-lg text-success"></span> Add Vertical gauge</li>
            <li class="list-group-item text-truncate"><span class="bi-plus-lg text-success"></span> Add Speedometer</li>
            <li class="list-group-item text-truncate"><span class="bi-plus-lg text-success"></span> Add Reverse parameter to Linear and Vertical gauges</li>
            <li class="list-group-item text-truncate"><span class="bi-recycle text-purple"></span> Split legend in two separated components, one to draw vertical and the other to draw horizontally</li>
            <li class="list-group-item text-truncate"><span class="bi-exclamation-triangle text-warning"></span> Mark Obsolete the old legendbar component</li>
        </ul>
    </div>
</div>
<div class="row border-top border-bottom mb-3">
