            <li class="list-group-item text-truncate"><span class="bi-check2 text-primary"></span> Optimized barcharts and radarchart svg drawing</li>
            <li class="list-group-item text-truncate"><span class="bi-check2 text-primary"></span> Improved labels positioning</li>
            <li class="list-group-item text-truncate"><span class="bi-x-lg text-danger"></span> Fix title of svg elements</li>
            <li class="list-group-item text-truncate"><span class="bi-x-lg text-danger"></span> Fix grid in radar and polar charts</li>
        </ul>
    </div>
</div>
