            <li class="list-group-item text-truncate"><span class="bi-exclamation-triangle text-warning"></span> Mark Obsolete the direction parameter in barchart component</li>
            <li class="list-group-item text-truncate"><span class="bi-recycle text-purple"></span> Split barchart in two separated components, one to draw vertical and the other to draw horizontally</li>
            <li class="list-group-item text-truncate"><span class="bi-x-lg text-danger"></span> Fix pie and donut charts orientation</li>
